# Stata intermediates, and the CSVs they produce.
#
# The CSVs are not lost by ignoring them here: make-fixtures.R writes validated
# copies into slopepower/tests/testthat/fixtures/, and those are the committed
# ones the test suite reads. Keeping a second copy in this directory would only
# give the two something to drift apart on.
*.dta
*.csv

# 00_open_questions.log is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the raw evidence for
# the two questions about slopepower.ado -- in particular that mixed stores the
# by() residual variances as base plus a log-ratio offset -- it is 20 KB, and
# nobody without a Stata licence can regenerate it.
